### Quick Start Script

If you want a ready‑to‑run starter, clone this repo:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/ecommerce-starter.git
cd ecommerce-starter
cp .env.example .env.local
# Fill in your env vars
npm install
npm run dev
```

Happy coding! 🚀 If you hit any roadblocks or need deeper dives into specific parts (e.g., advanced state patterns, micro‑frontend architecture, headless CMS integration), just let me know.
